      "worked": "One possible pair is $504$ and $66\\,528$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}504&=2^3\\times3^2\\times7^1\\times11^0\\\\66\\,528&=2^5\\times3^3\\times7^1\\times11^1\\end{align*}$$\n\nChoose the smallest powers for the HCF and the largest powers for the LCM.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{HCF}(504,66\\,528)&=2^3\\times3^2\\times7^1\\times11^0\\\\\\operatorname{HCF}(504,66\\,528)&=504\\\\\\operatorname{LCM}(504,66\\,528)&=2^5\\times3^3\\times7^1\\times11^1\\\\\\operatorname{LCM}(504,66\\,528)&=66\\,528\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus $504$ and $66\\,528$ satisfy both conditions. Only one possible pair is required.",
